&HEAD CHID='periodic_channel_inlet', TITLE='Channel with a velocity inlet and periodic sides, one mesh' /

&MESH IJK=32,8,16, XB=0.0,2.0,0.0,0.5,0.0,1.0 /

&TIME T_END=4.0 /

&MISC SIMULATION_MODE='DNS', NOISE=.FALSE., STRATIFICATION=.FALSE., GVEC=0.,0.,0. /

&PRES SOLVER='UGLMAT' /

&RADI RADIATION=.FALSE. /

&DUMP DT_DEVC=0.2, SIG_FIGS=12, SIG_FIGS_EXP=3 /

&SPEC ID='LJ AIR', VISCOSITY=0.025, BACKGROUND=.TRUE. /

&SURF ID='INLET', VEL=-0.5, TAU_V=0. /

&VENT MB='XMIN', SURF_ID='INLET' /
&VENT MB='XMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT MB='YMIN', SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT MB='YMAX', SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT MB='ZMIN', SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT MB='ZMAX', SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /

&OBST XB=0.5,1.5,0.0,0.5,0.375,0.625 /

The inflow is 0.25 m3/s from the start. Volume flow through three planes downstream:

&DEVC ID='x=0.0625', QUANTITY='VOLUME FLOW', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='AREA INTEGRAL', XB=0.0625,0.0625,0.0,0.5,0.0,1.0 /
&DEVC ID='x=0.25', QUANTITY='VOLUME FLOW', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='AREA INTEGRAL', XB=0.25,0.25,0.0,0.5,0.0,1.0 /
&DEVC ID='x=1.75', QUANTITY='VOLUME FLOW', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='AREA INTEGRAL', XB=1.75,1.75,0.0,0.5,0.0,1.0 /

&TAIL /
